1
00:00:00,173 --> 00:00:01,213
(Howard's Mother(voice):)Why not?

2
00:00:01,382 --> 00:00:05,592
(Howard:)When I go to weddings
it's to scam on chunky bridesmaids.

3
00:00:05,762 --> 00:00:08,302
(Penny:)I don't know
what I would do with a date.

4
00:00:09,223 --> 00:00:10,433
(Leslie:)Oh, all right.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,140
(Leslie:)I understand.

6
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,980
(Howard:)Thanks.

7
00:00:14,604 --> 00:00:18,024
(Leslie:)Hey, I'm really sorry
about that Geneva trip.

8
00:00:18,566 --> 00:00:20,606
- What about it?
- Oh, didn't you hear?

9
00:00:20,777 --> 00:00:24,447
(Leslie:)I had to reduce the number of people going
and you didn't make the cut.

10
00:00:25,365 --> 00:00:26,495
(Howard:)When did that happen?

11
00:00:26,658 --> 00:00:28,948
(Leslie:)About 12 seconds ago.

12
00:00:30,662 --> 00:00:35,872
(Howard:)Hold on. Are you saying if I don't go
to the wedding, I can't go to Geneva?

13
00:00:36,292 --> 00:00:38,712
Well, actually, I'm trying not to say it.

14
00:00:38,878 --> 00:00:42,588
(Howard:)Okay, I'm sorry,
but that makes me a little uncomfortable.

15
00:00:42,757 --> 00:00:45,177
- How so?
- Because it's like you're controlling me...

16
00:00:45,343 --> 00:00:48,053
(Howard:)...with new equipment
and research trips.

17
00:00:48,221 --> 00:00:52,101
If I weren't controlling you with equipment
and trips, I'd be uncomfortable.

18
00:00:52,266 --> 00:00:54,856
- How so?
- Because we'd be in a real relationship...

19
00:00:55,019 --> 00:00:59,019
(Leslie:)...with feelings and all that crap.

